|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Helpdesk | 6/6 | 6/6 | 6/6 | 100% | 100% | 100% | 100% | 64% / 57% | $4.87 |
| Storefront | 6/6 | 5/6 | 6/6 | 100% | 100% | 100% | 100% | 72% / 48% | $3.36 |

